@startuml
[*] --> CreateUserAccount : [Initial State]

state "Create User Account" as CreateUserAccount
CreateUserAccount : entry / Start state
CreateUserAccount : do / Fill in required details
CreateUserAccount : exit / Login

CreateUserAccount --> Login : user creates account

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / Create user account
Login : do / Authenticate User
Login : exit / Logged In Successfully

Login --> ApplyForVisa : user logs in

state "Apply For Visa" as ApplyForVisa
ApplyForVisa : entry / Login
ApplyForVisa : do / Make Payment and Accept Application
ApplyForVisa : exit / View Status

ApplyForVisa --> ViewStatus : application accepted

state "View Status" as ViewStatus
ViewStatus : entry / Apply for visa
ViewStatus : do / Display status
ViewStatus : exit / Check Status

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : user views status

state "Check Status" as CheckStatus
CheckStatus : entry / View status
CheckStatus : do / Check application status
CheckStatus : exit / Cancel Application or Modify Details

CheckStatus --> CancelApplication : status is cancelled
CheckStatus --> ModifyDetails : status is not cancelled

state "Cancel Application" as CancelApplication
CancelApplication : entry / Check Status
CancelApplication : do / Cancel application
CancelApplication : exit / Logout

CancelApplication --> Logout : user cancels application

state "Modify Details" as ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails : entry / Check Status
ModifyDetails : do / Update details
ModifyDetails : exit / View Details or Logout

ModifyDetails --> ViewDetails : user modifies details

state "View Details" as ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / Modify Details
ViewDetails : do / Display details
ViewDetails : exit / Logout

ViewDetails --> Logout : user views details

state "Give Feedback" as GiveFeedback
GiveFeedback : entry / Check Status
GiveFeedback : do / Provide feedback
GiveFeedback : exit / Logout

GiveFeedback --> Logout : user gives feedback

state "Update Status" as UpdateStatus
UpdateStatus : entry / View Status
UpdateStatus : do / Update status
UpdateStatus : exit / Logout

UpdateStatus --> Logout : user updates status

Logout --> [*] : [Final State]
@enduml
